<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-τάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατά-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arrange</i> or <i>draw up
				together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς εἰς τὴν φάλαγγα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.32
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὰ εἰς τὴν ἑαυτῶν φιλίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					5.2.22
				</span></i>
			; <i>take into account</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πρώτην ἡμέραν . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.692
				</span></i>
			; <i>classify with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				2.11
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>range oneself beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ Ἀθηναίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.237.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>: metaph., <i>to be arranged
			harmoniously</i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				7.9
			</span></i>.</div>
